  sparkle:   "M12 3v4 M12 17v4 M3 12h4 M17 12h4 M6 6l2.5 2.5 M15.5 15.5L18 18 M18 6l-2.5 2.5 M8.5 15.5L6 18",
  badge:     "M8 3h8v6l-4 3-4-3z M12 12a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10z",
